  "citation": "Rogers A; Ely K; Serbin S (2017): Leaf Photosynthetic Parameters Vcmax and Jmax and Supporting Gas Exchange Data, Barrow, Alaska, 2012-2016. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.5440/1336809",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
